"Cloudflare quick tunnel (default), Bore, Ngrok, or Tailscale Funnel (must "
"already be logged in)."
msgstr ""
"Cloudflare quick tunnel (standard), Bore, Ngrok eller Tailscale Funnel "
"(måste redan vara inloggad)."

