"Ngrok authtoken; Cloudflare tunnel token; Bore server or 'server secret'. "
"Empty = provider default / CLI config. Unused for Tailscale."
msgstr ""
"Ngrok-authtoken; Cloudflare-tunneltoken; Bore-server eller \"server "
"secret\". Tom = leverantörsstandard / CLI-konfiguration. Används ej för "
"Tailscale."

